<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-MASHONALAND BEAT ENGLAND BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MASHONALAND BEAT ENGLAND BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mashonaland beat England by seven wickets on the third day of their four-day match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 197 and 180; Mashonaland 280 and 98-3.</p>
</text>
